#. L_ELD_039
msgid ""
"Agent Dark Mission Log, 1846 hours. Last \n"
"night we got a call from Cassandra de Vries. \n"
"A dataDyne team have taken Daniel Carrington \n"
"hostage at his private villa on the coast, \n"
"and they say they will spare his life in \n"
"exchange for the AI.\n"
msgstr ""
"Agent Dark Mission Log, 1846 hours. Last \n"
"night we got a call from Cassandra de Vries. \n"
"A dataDyne team have taken Daniel Carrington \n"
"hostage at his private villa on the coast, \n"
"and they say they will spare his life in \n"
"exchange for the AI.\n"

#. L_ELD_040
msgid ""
"Unfortunately, we don't have it. Daniel and \n"
"Dr. Caroll were at the villa to discuss \n"
"'matters of mutual interest.' It looks \n"
"like Daniel found a way to hide Dr. Caroll \n"
"inside the villa when the dataDyne hit \n"
"squad arrived.\n"
msgstr ""
"Unfortunately, we don't have it. Daniel and \n"
"Dr. Caroll were at the villa to discuss \n"
"'matters of mutual interest.' It looks \n"
"like Daniel found a way to hide Dr. Caroll \n"
"inside the villa when the dataDyne hit \n"
"squad arrived.\n"

#. L_ELD_041
msgid ""
"Hopefully our phoney negotiator ploy will \n"
"give me a chance to surprise the dataDyne \n"
"squad. This time it's not just my life \n"
"on the line.\n"
msgstr ""
"Hopefully our phoney negotiator ploy will \n"
"give me a chance to surprise the dataDyne \n"
"squad. This time it's not just my life \n"
"on the line.\n"

#. L_ELD_042
msgid "Sir? Are you injured?\n"
msgstr "Sir? Are you injured?\n"

#. L_ELD_043
msgid ""
"No, Joanna, I'm okay, but those dataDyne \n"
"thugs made me tell them where I'd hidden \n"
"Dr. Caroll. If only I'd held out for a \n"
"few minutes more...\n"
msgstr ""
"No, Joanna, I'm okay, but those dataDyne \n"
"thugs made me tell them where I'd hidden \n"
"Dr. Caroll. If only I'd held out for a \n"
"few minutes more...\n"

#. L_ELD_044
msgid ""
"It's not your fault, sir. I should have \n"
"been quicker.\n"
msgstr ""
"It's not your fault, sir. I should have \n"
"been quicker.\n"

#. L_ELD_045
msgid ""
"Don't blame yourself, Joanna. Dr. Caroll \n"
"told me that he expected this to happen. \n"
"Actually, when they recaptured him, the \n"
"dataDyne team got overconfident and let \n"
"slip a few facts when they thought I was \n"
"unconscious. They mentioned a meeting in \n"
"the G5 Building in Chicago, Illinois, \n"
"tonight. I want you to be there, but that \n"
"doesn't leave you a lot of time to get \n"
"ready.\n"
msgstr ""
"Don't blame yourself, Joanna. Dr. Caroll \n"
"told me that he expected this to happen. \n"
"Actually, when they recaptured him, the \n"
"dataDyne team got overconfident and let \n"
"slip a few facts when they thought I was \n"
"unconscious. They mentioned a meeting in \n"
"the G5 Building in Chicago, Illinois, \n"
"tonight. I want you to be there, but that \n"
"doesn't leave you a lot of time to get \n"
"ready.\n"

#. L_ELD_046
msgid ""
"That won't be a problem, sir. So, did \n"
"Dr. Caroll have any useful information \n"
"for you?\n"
msgstr ""
"That won't be a problem, sir. So, did \n"
"Dr. Caroll have any useful information \n"
"for you?\n"

#. L_ELD_047
msgid ""
"Oh, yes, indeed. He certainly did, and \n"
"I'll brief you when you're en route to \n"
"Chicago. We might still be able to help \n"
"him, even after those butchers remove his \n"
"personality. He thinks they'll keep a \n"
"copy of it in a safe place. It's about \n"
"time I called in some friends to deal \n"
"with dataDyne.\n"
msgstr ""
"Oh, yes, indeed. He certainly did, and \n"
"I'll brief you when you're en route to \n"
"Chicago. We might still be able to help \n"
"him, even after those butchers remove his \n"
"personality. He thinks they'll keep a \n"
"copy of it in a safe place. It's about \n"
"time I called in some friends to deal \n"
"with dataDyne.\n"

#. L_ELD_048
msgid "Operation denied - windmill is active.\n"
msgstr "Operation denied - windmill is active.\n"

#. L_ELD_049
msgid "Mission unsuccessful - enemy guard not captured.\n"
msgstr "Mission unsuccessful - enemy guard not captured.\n"
